OL,3,GNEWSATeam braced for debut in FA Cup
OL,4,Afirst round
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's football team is braced to
OL,7,Fmake history having qualified for the
OL,8,Ffirst round of the Women's FA Cup for
OL,9,Fthe first time in the club's history.
OL,11,FWorkington Town Women will make their
OL,12,Ffirst round debut against Mancunian
OL,13,FUnity Women at 14:00 GMT on 1 November
OL,14,Fafter the fixture was postponed due to
OL,15,FStorm Boelo.
OL,17,FInjured former club captain Naomi
OL,18,FFoster said the achievement was
OL,19,F"absolutely phenomenal" and a testament
OL,20,Fto the way the women's game had grown
OL,21,Fin west Cumbria.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
